    {
      "id": "ce-ces",
      "title": "ce or ces",
      "level": "A1",
      "labels": ["ce", "ces"],
      "listen": "Ce is a quick soft \"suh\", gone almost before it starts. Ces sounds like \"say\", longer and brighter. As with le and les, the word after them sounds the same either way, so the little word carries the whole meaning.",
