    {
      "id": "je-jai",
      "title": "je or j’ai",
      "level": "A2",
      "labels": ["je", "j’ai"],
      "listen": "Both start with the soft buzzing sound in the middle of English \"measure\". After it, je is a short \"uh\" that almost disappears, while j’ai is a clear \"ay\" like in \"day\". With these verbs the rest sounds identical, so that little vowel is the whole difference between doing it now and having already done it.",
      "items": [
        { "id": "je-jai-finis", "a": { "fr": "je finis", "en": "I finish" }, "b": { "fr": "j’ai fini", "en": "I finished" } },
        { "id": "je-jai-choisis", "a": { "fr": "je choisis", "en": "I choose" }, "b": { "fr": "j’ai choisi", "en": "I chose" } },
        { "id": "je-jai-dis", "a": { "fr": "je dis oui", "en": "I say yes" }, "b": { "fr": "j’ai dit oui", "en": "I said yes" } },
        { "id": "je-jai-ris", "a": { "fr": "je ris", "en": "I laugh" }, "b": { "fr": "j’ai ri", "en": "I laughed" } },
        { "id": "je-jai-reussis", "a": { "fr": "je réussis", "en": "I succeed" }, "b": { "fr": "j’ai réussi", "en": "I succeeded" } },
        { "id": "je-jai-remplis", "a": { "fr": "je remplis le verre", "en": "I fill the glass" }, "b": { "fr": "j’ai rempli le verre", "en": "I filled the glass" } },
        { "id": "je-jai-grandis", "a": { "fr": "je grandis", "en": "I am growing" }, "b": { "fr": "j’ai grandi", "en": "I grew" } },
        { "id": "je-jai-reflechis", "a": { "fr": "je réfléchis", "en": "I think it over" }, "b": { "fr": "j’ai réfléchi", "en": "I thought it over" } },
